# Naming, imports, routes

- Files: **kebab-case**. Feature pages: `sth-page.tsx` exporting `SthPage`.
- Shared imports: `@/components`, `@/lib`, `@/messages`, ….
- Same-feature imports: **relative**.
- Navigation/redirects/Links: only via typed helpers in `src/lib/routes.ts` (or equivalent), e.g. `routes.panel.dashboard()`.
- Post-login `next`: allowlist of specific panel routes only; else dashboard.
- Client providers: one `AppProviders` module; document order in-file.
- `cn`: from shadcn CLI. Do not apply Inter/Vazirmatn until explicitly requested after shadcn.
